; The read model shared by every arch-* consumer, and by the MCP server.
;
; It exists so the tools cannot drift on the thing that matters most — how the call graph is
; keyed and which edges are in a closure. Two subtly different copies of `edges` would produce
; two different answers to the same reachability question, and the whole point of this index is
; that a reachability answer means one thing.
(library
 (name arch_tools)
 (flags (:standard -w +8+11+26+27 -warn-error +8+11))
 (libraries caqti caqti.classic caqti.blocking caqti-driver-sqlite3 uri unix yojson))
